# HumSukhan Environment Configuration
# Client-side values only. NEVER place provider API secrets in the Flutter app.

# Supabase
SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here

# Google AI Studio (Gemini Flash)
GEMINI_API_KEY=your-gemini-api-key-here

# Server-side Supabase Edge Function secrets (configure in Supabase Dashboard)
